   "doc": "string primitives and bridges.\n\nBuilt on the `stringAsBytes` / `stringFromBytesUnchecked` builtins\nand on top of std/core/bytes.yoop. `stringFromBytes` validates UTF-8\nand is the wrapper users should reach for; `stringFromBytesUnchecked`\nis the underlying intrinsic and skips validation.\n\nNaming convention (intrinsics index):\n  * `_as_*` -> view, no allocation\n  * `_from_*` / `_slice` / `_concat` / `_concat_all` -> fresh allocation",
